        // shown as PRIME but the cohort hit 0-3 live and ~38-42% in audits.
        // OVER-lean (xERA gap) badge removed 2026-05-06 — audit shows 0-10
        // hit rate (claimed 59.3%, actual 0% on resolved sample). Don't
